sName":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"Our familiarity with each area we serve means we understand local conditions, common issues, and the best approaches for each neighborhood. We know the best times to schedule service, how to navigate different property types, and what to expect from the local climate."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700","children":"No matter which East Valley community you call home, you can count on Arizona window cleaning Pros for reliable, professional window cleaning service. We're your neighbors, and we're committed to helping you maintain a beautiful home with crystal-clear windows."}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section-padding gradient-bg","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-custom max-w-6xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center mb-16","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"What Our Customers Say"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-500 to-primary-600 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6","children":[["$","div","1",{"className":"card card-hover","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between mb-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 mb-1","children":"Sarah M."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"Mesa, AZ"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex ml-2","children":[["$","svg","0",{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.1